# Animation Rules

- Use only GSAP free-tier features. Do not use Club GSAP plugins such as MorphSVG or SplitText.
- Put GSAP code inside `useGSAP` from `@gsap/react`, not `useEffect`.
- Register `ScrollTrigger` in each section component that uses it.
- Use a scoped ref with `useGSAP` so cleanup happens automatically.
- Keep animation logic inside the section component it belongs to. Do not move process-page animations into a global animation file.
- Prefer timed entrance animations that play once on viewport entry.
- Use scroll-scrubbed animation only when the interaction depends on scroll position, like the rotating disc in `TimeSection`.
- Match the current process-page brief:
  - `HeroSection`: full-width image, dark overlay, load-in copy reveal, subtle scroll parallax.
  - `IngredientsSection`: three depth layers, timed entrance sequence, eggs last.
  - `TimeSection`: rotating moon-to-sun disc with scrubbed scroll motion.
  - `OvenSection`: looping steam elements over the oven scene.
  - `ResultSection`: fade-and-scale image reveal with delayed copy.
